### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Listar todos os alocados
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAlocado
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar alocado por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAlocadoByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar alocado
POST http://localhost:40000/insertAlocado
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Alocação do Boi Nelore",
    "datainicio": "2026-11-24",
    "datafinal": "2026-12-24",
    "animalid": 1,
    "piqueteid": 1
}

### Atualizar alocado
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateAlocado/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Alocação atualizada",
    "datainicio": "2026-11-25",
    "datafinal": "2026-12-30",
    "animalid": 1,
    "piqueteid": 1
}

### Excluir alocado
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteAlocado/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}